&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You don’t necessarily need to come from a traditional Account Management background. Perhaps you’ve managed a restaurant or worked in hospitality, where you were responsible for operations, commercial results, customer experience, or revenue growth. Or maybe you’ve already managed a portfolio of clients or partners, identifying opportunities, upselling, and helping them grow their business.&amp;nbsp;What matters most is that you bring strong &lt;strong&gt;ownership, commercial thinking, relationship-building skills, and curiosity&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;You’ll own and develop a portfolio of &lt;strong&gt;small and medium-sized local restaurant partners in Shymkent city,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;working closely with independent venues and growing local businesses. You’ll play an important role in understanding the local restaurant scene, identifying growth opportunities, and helping our partners get more value from Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the growth of a portfolio of &lt;strong&gt;small and medium-sized local restaurant partners&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
