&lt;li&gt;Continuously analyze the local market and identify growth opportunities and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track competitor activities and translate insights into actionable strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and optimize account management processes and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
