&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Country Manager and Director for Marketplace, you’ll own the Denmark marketplace P&amp;amp;L and play a central role in shaping our next phase of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Denmark is a mature and highly successful Wolt market, with strong fundamentals and significant opportunity ahead. With competition increasing and consumer behaviour evolving, our next focus is on unlocking new sources of growth, while continuing to strengthen marketplace performance and our position in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll set the marketplace strategy, and sit at the intersection of operations, product, marketing and customer experience — making the trade-offs that determine how well the marketplace performs today and how strong it will be tomorrow. Working closely with other senior leaders across Wolt, you’ll identify where to invest, where to change course and where the next wave of growth can come from. You’ll also play a key role in expanding Wolt into new occasions and geographies, strengthening selection and building a marketplace that continues to deliver value for our customers, merchants and couriers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the direction for Wolt Denmark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the market and build our long term position in the market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a clear direction for growth and profitability while maintaining the quality and customer experience that differentiate Wolt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance supply, demand, customer experience and unit economics — often when the right answer isn’t obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the biggest opportunities and constraints across the marketplace and decide where Wolt should focus its energy and investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn strategic priorities into clear plans that teams across the organisation can execute against&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Marketplace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the P&amp;amp;L and overall performance of our marketplace business in Wolt Denmark, from growth and revenue to variable profit and contribution margin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the priorities that move the marketplace forward improving gross order value, selection, quality, affordability and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular business reviews with our leadership teams, turning performance data into clear decisions and actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance short-term commercial opportunities with the long-term health, quality and economics of the marketplace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Across Wolt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together senior leaders across Commercial, Operations, Marketing, Support, Finance and Analytics around a shared set of business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead decisions on investment, resources and market strategy for Denmark, influencing across teams and functions without relying on formal reporting lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge assumptions, create alignment and make the calls needed to maintain a thriving business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlock the next wave of growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives that expand and strengthen the marketplace, from market development and geographic expansion to entirely new growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen merchant selection and commercial performance to make Wolt increasingly relevant to Danish consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the operational capabilities required for our next phase of growth, including self-delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find new ways to grow by becoming relevant across more daily and seasonal occasions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what works, turn it into a repeatable playbook and scale it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring the team together&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust across teams and bring people with you, especially when priorities compete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead our country All Hands and bring more than 500+ colleagues in Denmark together around a shared direction, ambition and purpose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar for how we operate — ambitious in what we want to achieve, pragmatic in how we get there and humble enough to keep learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our People and Workplace teams on the culture and employee experience that will help Wolt Denmark thrive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent Wolt in Denmark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Public Affairs and Communications to strengthen Wolt’s reputation and position in Denmark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Wolt externally as Country Manager, building trusted relationships with relevant stakeholders and acting as a senior voice for the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Wolt Denmark in relevant legal and financial matters and serve on the board of Wolt Denmark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to shape the next chapter of Wolt in Denmark?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited by the opportunity to lead one of Wolt’s most established markets, solve complex marketplace challenges and build the next chapter of growth in Denmark, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your commercial judgement, strategic thinking and leadership to Wolt — and help shape a marketplace that creates more value for customers, merchants and couriers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply now and tell us how you would take Denmark’s marketplace to its next level.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt Market is Wolt’s own chain of dark stores, designed to deliver exceptional convenience and a world-class customer experience through fast and reliable grocery delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Country Manager to lead and grow the Wolt Market business in Cyprus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Country Manager, you will be accountable for the overall performance of Wolt Market in the country, owning the local P&amp;amp;L and driving sustainable growth, profitability, and operational excellence. You will lead the local organization across commercial, operations, and supply chain functions, ensuring strong execution and a consistently high standard of customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with regional stakeholders, you will set priorities, develop local strategy, and build a high-performing team capable of delivering scalable and sustainable business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key tasks and responsibilities of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own full country or cluster PnL, including revenue growth, margin development, cost control, and overall profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the commercial strategy for the market, including assortment, pricing, promotions, and supplier partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop local Category, Content and Commercial Finance Operations teams, ensuring strong ownership, capability building, and performance discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure healthy order economics by balancing growth initiatives with operational and financial efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive structured performance management by defining KPIs, reviewing results, and ensuring corrective actions are implemented when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Regional Operations and Supply Chain counterparts to ensure operational capacity, availability, and service levels support commercial plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate regional and global initiatives into clear local action plans, ensuring timely and high quality execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify growth opportunities within the market and develop business plans to capture them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong cross functional collaboration in the market and act as the integrator across commercial, operations, and supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the market in regional planning forums and contribute insights to regional and global strategy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with local regulations, health and safety standards, and company policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen reporting frameworks and performance transparency to enable data driven decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in general management, commercial leadership, or market leadership roles with proven PnL ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in retail, grocery, e-commerce, or other multi site operating environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and negotiation experience with suppliers and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience, including building and developing high performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to translate data into actionable decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a matrix organization and collaborating across multiple functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think strategically while maintaining strong operational focus and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent skills in G Suite or MS Office, especially Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For candidates based in Malta, the total target compensation for this role is &lt;strong&gt;€6020 – €7525 gross&lt;/strong&gt; per month. The successful candidate&#39;s starting compensation will be determined based on several job-related factors, including skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. In addition to cash compensation, eligible employees may participate in the company&#39;s equity program. The annual equity grant for this role is expected to be valued between &lt;strong&gt;USD 52,300 and USD 65,300&lt;/strong&gt;, subject to applicable plan terms and eligibility requirements. Equity awards are granted as part of a &lt;strong&gt;four-year vesting program&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/T10nqKEgkmE&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt’s Courier Employment team is building something that doesn’t really exist yet — a cross-country infrastructure for employed courier operations across multiple geographies. We sit at the intersection of operations, people, legal, and compliance, and we’re doing it largely from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The function currently spans three countries (Finland, Germany, Croatia), each at a different stage of maturity and with different legal frameworks. Courier employment is managed in all these countries by a functional team handling strategy, structure and resources, and country-level teams focused on execution and operational excellence from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate in a fast-moving environment with a high degree of uncertainty — regulatory, operational, and structural. If you’re energised by the possibilities and want to be the person who builds the playbook, this might be the right role for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Croatia doesn&#39;t have an independent Courier HR operating model yet. It has support from the general employee HR team, great people working hard, manual workarounds, and a scale-up landing in the next few months that the current setup wasn&#39;t built to absorb. This role exists to establish Courier HR expertise within the function and build the processes needed while running the team&#39;s day-to-day HR operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Courier HR Senior Specialist in Croatia, you&#39;ll own the full employee lifecycle for a fast-growing courier workforce: onboarding, contracts, documentation, leave, and the HR side of a workforce that includes couriers relocating from abroad. This includes tracking of work permits and other integration and compliance related matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be supported by the function’s core team and leadership and work closely with your Courier HR Lead, the Workforce Ops team, Legal, and the sourcing agencies bringing couriers in. You&#39;ll be the most senior Courier HR operator on the ground in Croatia day-to-day — which means you&#39;ll be trusted to make independent decisions and participate actively in building foundations and standards that will apply across all markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee lifecycle execution at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own onboarding, contracts, documentation, and leave administration for Croatia&#39;s employed couriers, including the operational HR side of relocating couriers from abroad (documentation, work permit tracking, compliance).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegating and syncing with a Tier 1 HR team that handles standard inbound tickets and manual entry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain accurate employee records across HR systems as the courier base scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle the volume and pace of onboarding waves without letting quality or compliance slip.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the judgment calls on ambiguous or non-standard cases that come up, escalating appropriately to your Courier HR Lead or Legal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process and SOP creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create SOPs, checklists, and documentation in collaboration with the functional Process &amp;amp; Systems Senior Specialist based on cross-market standards and calibrated to local requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where the current setup will break under the incoming scale-up, then plan and build for it before it breaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Process &amp;amp; Systems Senior Specialist on anything that should become a cross-country standard rather than a local fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the day-to-day HR point of contact for the sourcing agencies bringing couriers into Croatia, ensuring HR-side obligations (documentation, onboarding timing, permits) are met on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Workforce Ops to keep HR and operational onboarding in sync as waves of new couriers arrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag structural risks early and initiate appropriate action in collaboration with your Lead and functional colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There’s no single background that defines this role — but the people who do well here tend to combine sharp analytical thinking with genuine operational curiosity. Some things that matter:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in HR operations, people operations, or workforce administration — ideally somewhere that involved real scale, strict deadlines, or a workforce with cross-border or compliance complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with foreign worker documentation, work permits, residence permits, or employment compliance processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine ability to operate without a finished playbook. If &quot;there&#39;s no process for this yet&quot; makes you anxious rather than interested, this isn&#39;t the right role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail that holds up under volume and pressure — the documentation has legal weight, and the standard shouldn’t drop with rapidly increasing volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgment about what to decide yourself and what to escalate. This role only works if you can be trusted with ambiguity — and trusted to know your own limits within it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Croatian (C1-C2) and professional level in English (B2-C2) are a requirement. Given the courier population arriving from abroad, comfort working through language and documentation barriers is a real asset — additional languages (Spanish, for instance) are a plus but not requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a hybrid model from our Zagreb office (4 office days, Wednesday optional work-from-home day).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most HR operations roles ask you to run a process well. This one asks you to build the process while running it, for a workforce that&#39;s about to grow faster than the current setup was designed for, in a market where the team is small and knowledge is yet to be mapped to documentation. You will work with a team of experts in multiple countries, giving you a unique chance to influence our strategies, standards and ways of working while constantly learning something new.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If it sounds like the kind of challenge you would enjoy solving, and if you are inspired by the potential of directly impacting the experience of hard working individuals establishing themselves in a new country, this will be a great opportunity for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that this is a fixed-term contract until Dec 31st 2026, with a possibility to extend to a permanent contract. We’re expecting you to be able to start working with us during August-early September.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sport benefit (PassSport)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tax-free commuter benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A monthly lunch benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt Credits Cashback program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the Employee Assistance Program (free, confidential mental health support) and the Cuckoo wellness app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application and resume in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hiring process includes conversations with the talent acquisition partner, hiring managers and a practical assignment with a final cross-functional discussion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of a motivated team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you a team player with great communication skills? Do you enjoy working in a dynamic environment? If your answer is yes - then read further!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for &lt;strong&gt;full-time 40h/week&lt;/strong&gt; Customer Service Representatives to join our Support team in Tirana, Albania!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicating&amp;nbsp;with customers via live&amp;nbsp;chat or over the phone using a Wolt tone of voice and adapting to the customers tone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that the delivery operations run smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing our support function together with the support team as well as other teams within Wolt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great communication skills with a personal touch, and a customer-obsessed and team-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fast learner, you have no problem with multitasking, and you are ready to work in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can work in shifts in mornings, evenings and weekends, as well as public holidays - our support is open seven days a week&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in Albanian&amp;nbsp;language and you have professional working proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are located in Tirana.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an on-going basis, so send through your application along with your CV as soon as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;💙&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/dob25eOXkyA&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, we’re building one of the most exciting media ecosystems in Europe - helping partners grow through Wolt Ads and Wolt Promos. By joining the team, you’ll be at the forefront of digital advertising, working on campaigns that drive visibility, engagement, and real results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help partners grow their business by getting closer to the customers who matter most. Through high-impact placements across our app (and beyond), we help them boost brand visibility, reach new audiences, and increase sales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a motivated and detail-oriented Ad Operations Specialist to join our Wolt Ads team in &lt;strong&gt;Almaty&lt;/strong&gt;. In this role, you will support the Ad Operations team in managing ad and promo campaigns, ensuring they are executed efficiently and delivering actionable performance insights. This is an excellent opportunity to join a fast-growing organization within Wolt and develop further skills in ad operations, data analysis, and campaign management within a dynamic and fast-growing advertising business.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be responsible for managing campaigns end-to-end for brands and merchants who advertise on the Wolt platform. In this role, you’ll take ownership of the campaign from the moment it’s submitted by the sales/account team, all the way through campaign launch, monitoring and optimization, and ultimately invoicing the campaign. You will become a subject matter expert in our platforms and products and support the sales/account team to drive campaign volume and advertiser retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and manage advertising campaigns on the Wolt platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team in making sure campaigns run smoothly and on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and optimize campaign performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with data to produce and interpret insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Sales and Account Management teams to support our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help improve how we work by spotting inefficiencies and suggesting better ways of doing things&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience executing ad operations campaigns or other merchandising/platform operations - a background as a Campaign Manager, Campaign Operations Manager, Ads Specialist, E-commerce Merchandising Specialist, or Campaign Specialist, would be a good fit for the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging data to make discoveries about performance and/or to troubleshoot bugs with engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention-to-detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can handle a high volume of complex and high-priority tasks, making trade-off decisions constantly with a high degree of autonomy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English, Russian - proficient working knowledge; Kazakh would be a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, you get the best of both worlds: the dynamic energy of a scale-up with a highly sought-after product, combined with the stability of a well-established company with strong owners and a long-term outlook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 Independent work in a dynamic, international team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🩺 Medical Insurance and strengthened sick leaves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Career growth and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💙 Employee Assistance Program—therapy and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍽️ Discount on your Wolt orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧑‍🎓 Wolt-wide training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎉 Team budgets for celebrations and bonding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍊 Fruits and drinks at the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you’ll love it:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Build the future of advertising: Work at the intersection of ad tech, commerce, and growth - you&#39;re not just managing accounts, you&#39;re building a media platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Own significant revenue: Enterprise partnerships mean real money and meaningful impact on company&#39;s P&amp;amp;L. You&#39;ll see the direct result of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎯 Strategic partnerships, not transactions: Move beyond typical sales roles - you&#39;ll develop deep relationships with sophisticated partners and help them grow their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 Expand into new frontiers: Be part of the team launching Wolt Ads into new verticals and regions. You&#39;ll have a hand in shaping the platform&#39;s future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 Collaborate with the best: Work with ambitious, talented teams across Global Ads, Account Management, Product, and Marketing who are laser-focused on driving results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💙 Big hearts, small egos: Join a team that celebrates wins together, supports each other through challenges, and genuinely believes in the power of partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt Ads is constantly expanding and evolving—check out how we help businesses grow and what opportunities lie ahead!&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;https://explore.wolt.com/en/fin/wolt-ads&quot;&gt;https://explore.wolt.com/en/fin/wolt-ads&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/UfaE8bk9SHs?t=3s&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;DoorDash&#39;s mission is to grow and empower local economies — and in Europe, that mission comes to life through two of the continent&#39;s most dynamic consumer brands: Wolt and Deliveroo. Together, they bring an extraordinary range of products to people&#39;s doors, from restaurant meals and groceries to electronics, beauty, pet supplies, pharmaceuticals and more. Underpinning it all is a broad and ambitious technology platform spanning logistics, retail software, financial solutions and autonomous delivery, as well as Wolt&#39;s own grocery retail operation under the Wolt Market brand. With thousands of merchant partners across dozens of European markets, the business is growing fast — and the regulatory landscape is growing more complex with it. To help us navigate this evolving environment, we are looking for a Director of Policy Development to join the team, working across our European and Middle Eastern operations at Wolt and Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced policy professional to join the Global Policy Team’s Policy Development and Research Group. The Director level role will shape the legal and regulatory framework for a new sector of the economy at a pivotal moment in Europe and the Middle East. This expansive role will focus on legislative analysis, developing our policy positions with input from cross-functional business teams, and strategic input on our policy priorities. You will work closely with Policy Team members across Europe and the Middle East and stakeholders across the company to develop and support the adoption of policies that best serve couriers, merchants, and consumers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning and driving Wolt and Deliveroo&#39;s regulatory analysis on high-impact legislative proposals across Europe and the Middle East — translating complex law-making processes into clear business, operational and commercial outcomes for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing sharp legal and legislative expertise to our most ambiguous and high-stakes regulatory challenges — particularly around the future of work for courier partners — and making sound judgments with incomplete information under time pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a strategic engine of the policy development function: partnering with our Public Affairs Team to understand the political landscape and how we can best advance our priorities through legislative and regulatory processes. .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and driving alignment across Legal, Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, Product, Finance and Communications, acting as the connective tissue between policy and the business functions that need to act on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As needed, supporting our Public Affairs Team in external engagement with policymakers, regulators, industry groups, and other stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engaging with academics, think tanks, and other stakeholders to build thought leadership in cutting-edge policy issues — shaping the broader policy environment and building our credibility as a constructive voice in the regulatory debate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing legal, operational and financial trade-offs when advising on regulatory risk, ensuring that our positions are not only legally sound but commercially realistic and executable at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of professional experience from the legal field and/or government or policy development in an international setting, with a demonstrated record of success focusing on a wide range of legislative and regulatory issues. In-house experience is considered an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master of Laws degree from a reputable university in the EU, or strong legal experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous professional exposure to digital platforms, mobile apps or software solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who isn’t afraid to roll up their sleeves no matter the task.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, along with excellent interpersonal and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working in a global business environment, demonstrating the ability to operate with strong cross-cultural competence and flexibility with working hours – plus the ability to occasionally travel to other cities in Europe, as well as the U.S. to further global collaboration across the team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points for experience in employment and labour law, in international settings at a law firm, in-house at a technology company, and/or with a U.S.-based company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next Steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an ambitious team, then click below to apply and let’s get the conversation going! Please submit both your CV and a cover letter as supporting documents for your application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Along with a competitive salary and benefits, you will also be eligible for:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to be part of building something exceptional, in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lots of learning and growth in a globally scaling tech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model, blending office presence with flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to neighborhoods of the world. As part of that mission, we’re building a unified platform designed to power DoorDash, Wolt, Deliveroo, and future growth. The primary computing platform is mainly a code execution framework that lets product teams compose business logic into graphs, while the team owns the platform, runtime, and operational experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re now looking for an Engineering Manager to lead our EU-based Computing Platform team. This is a team of 5 engineers working on a foundational, mission-critical platform that helps simplify backend development at scale by reducing operational overhead for product teams and making cross-team changes easier to build, test, and ship. In this role, you’ll grow the team, shape the roadmap, and work closely with product and platform partners and your manager to make the Computing Platform more reliable, performant, and easier to adopt across Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact engineering leadership role at the intersection of platform strategy, people leadership, and execution. You’ll lead a team building core capabilities that help engineers ship business logic without owning the burden of running services themselves. Success in this role means growing a strong team, driving clear priorities, and delivering platform improvements that make the Computing Platform easier for developers, and safer, faster and more reliable to use at massive scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of engineers, creating clarity, strong execution habits, and a healthy engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team’s roadmap and delivery across core Computing Platform areas such as performance, scaling and resource management, I/O optimization, integrations, developer experience, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with adjacent platform teams and product domains onboarding to Pedregal, turning their needs into platform capabilities and smoother adoption paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide architectural and technical decisions for the Computing Platform runtime and developer-facing APIs, balancing reliability, simplicity, and long-term extensibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar on operational excellence by improving reliability, debuggability, and support for teams running production workloads on the Computing Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the next phase of the Computing Platform as a foundational platform for Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash through hiring, prioritization, cross-team alignment, and org leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3+ years of solid experience as an engineering manager, including directly leading and growing a team of engineers in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5+ years of strong background in backend, infrastructure, product or platform engineering, and good technical judgment when working with distributed systems, runtime platforms, or developer-facing infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to turn an ambitious platform vision into clear priorities, pragmatic execution plans, and reliable delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working across team boundaries and partnering with engineering, product, and platform stakeholders to drive alignment and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care deeply about people leadership and know how to coach engineers, create clarity, and build a healthy, high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a high bar for engineering quality, reliability, and operational excellence, and can help teams navigate production challenges with calm and structure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to lead a foundational platform team working on one of the most important backend building blocks. The Computing Platform is designed to simplify how engineers build and operate business logic at scale, and the work of this team has the potential to influence developer productivity, system reliability, and platform adoption across Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get to work on meaningful engineering leadership challenges with broad scope: growing a strong team, shaping technical direction, and helping define how mission-critical compute platform evolves as more domains onboard. If you’re excited by high-leverage platform work, complex distributed systems problems, and the chance to have impact far beyond a single product surface, this is a rare role to step into.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our &lt;strong&gt;IT Automation&lt;/strong&gt; team, building the internal applications and automation that power the employee experience across DoorDash and Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team develops the platforms behind employee lifecycle processes, HR systems, self-service experiences, and business automation used by thousands of employees globally. As Engineering Manager, you&#39;ll lead a team of talented software engineers while driving technical strategy, delivering high-impact initiatives, and partnering closely with stakeholders across Engineering, IT, HR, and Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to make a significant impact on how internal technology enables the business to scale while helping shape the next generation of AI-powered employee experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and grow a team of software engineers across multiple locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical direction and delivery of internal applications that improve the employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, HR, IT, and business stakeholders to understand priorities and translate them into scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architecture decisions, engineering best practices, and continuous improvements across the team&#39;s codebase and development processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex cross-functional initiatives from planning through successful delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance delivery, technical quality, and long-term platform strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help modernize and consolidate internal platforms as DoorDash and Wolt continue integrating systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an AI-first engineering culture by adopting AI-assisted development tools and identifying opportunities to embed AI into internal applications and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment where engineers can grow, collaborate, and do their best work while delivering meaningful business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring significant software engineering experience, ideally 8+ years building scalable production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have previous experience leading and developing high-performing engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable balancing technical leadership with people leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong full-stack development experience using technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;React, Node.js, and Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring experience designing scalable software architectures and cloud-native applications on AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of successfully delivering large cross-functional engineering initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy working in a fast-moving environment where priorities evolve alongside business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be passionate about leveraging AI to improve software development, engineering productivity, and internal products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, pragmatic, and ownership-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All applications are reviewed by a real human, so please be patient. Qualified candidates will have the opportunity to speak with a member of our recruiting team before moving on to meet the hiring manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly technical leadership role. The interview process includes a live coding and architecture interview, followed by conversations focused on engineering leadership, operational delivery, cross-functional collaboration, and DoorDash&#39;s leadership principles. You&#39;ll also meet future peers and business partners to learn more about the team and how we work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to fill this role as quickly as possible, but are committed to finding the right candidate who will be successful in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐ Join Wolt as an English-Speaking Support Associate ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the lookout for full-time (40 hrs/week) Support Associates who speak English fluently to join our amazing Support team and be a part of our Shared Service Center, supporting multiple Wolt countries worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💙 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Support Associate at Wolt, your key responsibility is to ensure that our customers and partners enjoy a positive experience and receive the help they need within the expected timeframes.&amp;nbsp;We’re looking for colleagues who value a stable and pleasant work environment just as much as continuous learning and skill development in delivering exceptional customer service in a fast-paced setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌟 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role, you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle customer, courier, and merchant inquiries through live chat, phone, and email support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve escalations, operational issues, and time-sensitive cases quickly and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support multiple Wolt markets, countries, user types, and ticket flows depending on business and queue needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a high-quality customer experience by using empathy, clear communication, and Wolt’s tone of voice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow internal processes, company policies, playbooks, refund policies, escalation paths, and operational guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use multiple tools at the same time, including support platforms, communication channels, knowledge bases, and operational tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up to date with new processes, market changes, training materials, and internal updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📝 Your profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and plenty of patience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persistence, kindness, and empathy help you find the best solution for everyone involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great attention to detail and strong focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re not intimidated by complex tasks that require quick thinking and good organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You handle stressful situations, you multitask, and you can handle multiple incoming interactions with ease&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making fast decisions in challenging moments is one of your strengths&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the importance of great customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re fluent in both Serbian and English (C1)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have at least a high school diploma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to work in shifts, and on weekends, holidays, we operate 24/7&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable with new apps and systems&lt;strong&gt;, and adapt quickly to changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any previous work experience is welcome, especially in a similar role - but it’s not a requirement! We’ll teach you everything you need to know.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Starting salary: &lt;/strong&gt;105000 RSD gross + 50% extra pay for weekends, 110% holidays, and 26% night hours (22-06 hours)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-day work week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;60 minutes of paid break time&lt;/strong&gt; - You will receive the legally required 30-minute paid break, plus an additional 30 minutes of paid break provided by us as an employee benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least &lt;strong&gt;25 days of paid vacation&lt;/strong&gt;, with a possibility for additional paid days off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Health&lt;/strong&gt; Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15% cashback on your Wolt orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to the&lt;strong&gt; FitPass &lt;/strong&gt;program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-week &lt;strong&gt;structured onboarding&lt;/strong&gt; program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured mentoring from our Team Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training sessions, workshops, and learning opportunities to enhance your skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear &lt;strong&gt;career development path&lt;/strong&gt;, your growth as a Support Associate is our priority! With our support, you’ll have opportunities to grow and build your career within the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt-wide training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/strong&gt; for you and your immediate family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A friendly, tolerant, and inclusive work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All necessary equipment for your work (laptop, monitor, headset)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⏱️ Working hours:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt Customer Support operates 7 days a week, 365 days a year, 24/7.&lt;br&gt;You’ll be working in 8-hour morning, afternoon shifts or night shifts, including weekends and holidays, depending on business and organizational needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💻 T&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;echnical requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong and reliable internet connection and a suitable remote working environment without distractions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a fully remote position, but all work must be performed from Serbia only&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must also be available to fully participate in the training and onboarding process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next steps:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What to expect from onboarding:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your onboarding starts through our e-learning platform, and during your first week, you’ll work closely with a trainer. Training lasts 2 weeks, and during this period, you’ll always have someone to guide you through your shifts. After that, you’ll be supported by your Team Lead, who also acts as your mentor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We review applications continuously, so don’t wait! Apply as soon as possible, and we’ll get back to you shortly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Enterprise team in Stockholm works with some of Sweden&#39;s most prominent restaurant partners, helping them grow and thrive on the Wolt platform. We&#39;re now looking for a Team Lead to own a portfolio of key restaurant accounts while leading and developing a local team of Account Managers — someone who combines sharp analytical thinking with genuine care for both partners and people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind Wolt&#39;s restaurant enterprise partnerships in Sweden — owning key relationships, coaching your team, and building the processes that make everything run smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you&#39;ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop 4-5 senior Account Managers managing restaurant partners across Sweden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing the largest global and local enterprise partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your team in building robust relationships with partners to understand their needs and identify opportunities for growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive commercial performance across GOV growth, Wolt Ads, Promotions, Wolt Drive, Storefront, and other strategic priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support team in commercial negotiations and operational problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high performance, high ownership team through clear priorities, regular coaching, performance follow-up, and ongoing collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example by demonstrating Wolt values and behaviors, creating a positive work environment that enables the team to thrive and grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Business Development Manager, Account Manager, or similar commercial role — ideally with experience in restaurants, hospitality, or a marketplace/platform environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading a team: you know how to motivate, coach, and hold people accountable while keeping morale high&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills — you&#39;re comfortable working with data to identify trends, spot opportunities, and make decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, both internal and external, and the ability to quickly build credibility with senior partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured project management approach — you can juggle multiple priorities without dropping the ball&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Swedish and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join a team that delivers real value across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make Wolt&#39;s business even stronger, and the impact you make here will be recognized all the way to the top.You&#39;ll work closely with your team and team lead in an environment designed to help your potential thrive. We don&#39;t just want you to reach your goals, we want to redefine what &quot;great&quot; looks like.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our spacious office sits in a vibrant, growing part of Stockholm, with a gym just across the street and plenty of restaurants nearby. The Swedish team takes genuine pride in well-being and a strong, people-first culture. Gatherings, afterworks, and celebrations are a regular part of life here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you’ll love it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Global and growing fast: Be part of a fast-moving scaleup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤩 Ride of a lifetime: Accelerate your career and build your sales skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Instant impact: Take ownership and make a difference&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💙 Big hearts and small egos: Surround yourself with smart, friendly people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
