&lt;p&gt;This role is open to candidates with different levels of sales experience. Whether you’re building on a strong foundation and eager to take the next step, or you already have extensive experience driving complex sales and shaping sales strategies, Wolt will provide the platform for you to thrive. What matters most is your drive, curiosity, and willingness to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
