&lt;li&gt;Pitch and negotiate with decision-makers, demonstrating how Wolt can add value to their business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close deals and manage contracts to ensure a smooth onboarding process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams (e.g., Account Management, Operations, Marketing) to guarantee partners’ success after launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous B2B sales experience, preferably in restaurant sales or retail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent command of Swedish and English. Speaking another language is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively, as the role involves significant travel with overnight stays across Sweden (up to 75% of your working time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A driver’s license is not required, but considered a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
