&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt is on a growth journey as part of the DoorDash family. As we continue to scale, we need to ensure our finance systems evolve into a robust, scalable, and intelligent ecosystem. This brings us to you, our next &lt;strong&gt;Finance Systems Development Manager&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will act as a &lt;strong&gt;an architect of our finance systems landscape&lt;/strong&gt;, with NetSuite ERP at its core. You will take a role in shaping how our systems scale across multiple geographies, ensuring performance, compliance, and long-term sustainability. Alongside development, you will drive architectural decisions, system governance, and continuous improvement of our finance technology stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as &lt;strong&gt;system owner and architect&lt;/strong&gt; for Wolt’s finance systems environment, centered around our Multi-Subsidiary NetSuite solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive the &lt;strong&gt;system architecture and development roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring scalability across markets and business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and oversee &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end solutions&lt;/strong&gt;, including integrations, data flows, and system structure across connected finance systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze, control, and improve &lt;strong&gt;system performance and process efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; across finance operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of &lt;strong&gt;customizations, scripts, and workflows&lt;/strong&gt; aligned with business and compliance needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate development, maintenance, and support activities with &lt;strong&gt;internal teams and external partners&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring solution stability and robustness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Finance stakeholders (Key Users, Process Owners) to translate business challenges into &lt;strong&gt;scalable system solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive &lt;strong&gt;automation and improvement opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;, including leveraging emerging technologies such as AI where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure &lt;strong&gt;system governance, documentation, and best practices&lt;/strong&gt; across the finance systems landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support system testing, integration efforts, and continuous improvement initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with &lt;strong&gt;NetSuite technical development and solution design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in a role combining &lt;strong&gt;systems ownership, architecture, and hands-on development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SuiteScript (1.0, 2.0, 2.x), SuiteBuilder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrations (REST, SOAP, RESTlets, SuiteAnalytics Connect)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and evolving &lt;strong&gt;complex, multi-entity / multi-country ERP environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;external partners and multiple internal stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of &lt;strong&gt;system processes, data flows, and integration patterns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;system roadmap planning and project delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate clearly with both &lt;strong&gt;technical stakeholders and finance end users&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seen as a strong advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;SuiteTax and global tax configurations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with applying &lt;strong&gt;AI or automation in finance systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in core finance processes (accounting, reporting)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;data-intensive or high-volume environments&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., FMCG, large-scale B2C)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-WM1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt is on a growth journey as part of the DoorDash family. As we scale, the reliability and efficiency of our payment and Procure-to-Pay (PTP) processes become increasingly critical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Finance Systems Specialist, Payments &amp;amp; PTP&lt;/strong&gt; to support the development and continuous improvement of these areas within our finance systems landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work hands-on with NetSuite and integrated systems, focusing on &lt;strong&gt;payments, Accounts Payable, and end-to-end PTP processes&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll play a key role in ensuring smooth, scalable, and accurate transaction processing across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and maintenance of &lt;strong&gt;payments and PTP processes&lt;/strong&gt; within NetSuite and connected systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and develop &lt;strong&gt;customizations, workflows, and scripts&lt;/strong&gt; supporting Accounts Payable and payment operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Finance teams to &lt;strong&gt;analyze issues and improve payment and PTP workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and maintain &lt;strong&gt;payment integrations&lt;/strong&gt;, including banks and payment service providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot issues related to &lt;strong&gt;transaction flows, reconciliations, and payment processing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in optimizing &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end PTP processes&lt;/strong&gt;, from invoice handling to payment execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal stakeholders and external partners on &lt;strong&gt;implementation and improvement initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to &lt;strong&gt;automation and efficiency improvements&lt;/strong&gt; in finance operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing, documentation, and rollout of enhancements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🧠 Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;NetSuite development or configuration&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly in finance-related areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SuiteScript (1.0, 2.0, 2.x), SuiteBuilder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflows and ERP customizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;payments, Accounts Payable, or PTP processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong&gt;payment flows, reconciliations, and financial transaction handling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;system integrations&lt;/strong&gt; (REST, SOAP, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;multiple stakeholders and external partners&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, delivery-oriented mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seen as an advantage:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;payment service providers, banking integrations, or treasury processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;high-volume transaction environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of &lt;strong&gt;finance operations and accounting basics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;automation and process improvement initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

