&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;s2gwge&quot; data-start=&quot;936&quot; data-end=&quot;1003&quot;&gt;Onboard new restaurant and retail partners to the Wolt platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;w2d6lr&quot; data-start=&quot;1004&quot; data-end=&quot;1125&quot;&gt;Communicate with partners via email and phone (mostly in German, all communication is remote - no in-person meetings)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;126ftah&quot; data-start=&quot;1126&quot; data-end=&quot;1185&quot;&gt;Guide partners through setup requirements and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qr8lnx&quot; data-start=&quot;1186&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot;&gt;Upload and update menus in Wolt’s internal systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gusrn2&quot; data-start=&quot;1241&quot; data-end=&quot;1309&quot;&gt;Check that all information is accurate, complete, and up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1yvzmd7&quot; data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1367&quot;&gt;Follow up on missing or unclear details with partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gv1kg2&quot; data-start=&quot;1368&quot; data-end=&quot;1443&quot;&gt;Work with internal teams to resolve issues and keep onboarding on track&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;k9b2jz&quot; data-start=&quot;1450&quot; data-end=&quot;1479&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1479&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v4ze3m&quot; data-start=&quot;1481&quot; data-end=&quot;1531&quot;&gt;Fluent German and English (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pk9y4g&quot; data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;Comfortable with phone communication and partner-facing tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xm4k8d&quot; data-start=&quot;1598&quot; data-end=&quot;1661&quot;&gt;Detail-oriented and confident working with systems and data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dk7afu&quot; data-start=&quot;1662&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Organized and able to manage multiple tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xacz6&quot; data-start=&quot;1710&quot; data-end=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;Proactive mindset - you notice when something is missing and follow up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gimckm&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1843&quot;&gt;Able to work independently in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
