&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an ambitious team shaping how partners experience Wolt from day one - apply and let’s get the conversation going! 🚀💙&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
