&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on a n on-going basis, so send through your application along with your CV as soon as possible! 💙&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/T10nqKEgkmE&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Calling all team-players - are you looking for a flexible role that could shape the future of retail? If so, then let’s talk!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for part-time Grocery Associates to join our Wolt Market team in &lt;strong&gt;Søborg&lt;/strong&gt;! 🤩&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking in orders through our Merchant app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Picking and packing groceries, and handing them to customers and courier partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unloading food and supplies that we receive from vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing our internal systems which include precise information about nutrients and allergens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining order and cleanliness of the store&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proactive and a fast learner with the ability to multitask&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are between 16-17 years old&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility with working in shifts in the mornings and evenings, including weekends and holidays - our Wolt Market is open 08.00-00.00.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from working in a grocery store is an advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required, Danish is a plus!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the right to work in Denmark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get by joining us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt credits cashback benefit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt-wide training programs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an on-going basis, so send through your application along with your CV as soon as possible! 💙&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/T10nqKEgkmE&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do you enjoy working in a dynamic work environment, have a customer-oriented mindset and love working with a fun team?&amp;nbsp;If your answer is yes - then read further!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wolt is a Finnish technology company and we’re best known for our food delivery platform. Food delivery was just a start, and now we are exploring and expanding our platform with other business verticals in retail and grocery. We’ve grown significantly in the last three years, expanding our operations from just four countries across the Nordics, to 23 countries across Europe and Asia today. And we’re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role you are looking at is a part of Wolt Market - our very own grocery stores that deliver unprecedented convenience and world leading customer experience. People across Denmark&amp;nbsp;can order their groceries and have them delivered within 30 minutes!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are searching for full-time and part-time Grocery Associates to join our awesome team. In this role you are right in the heart of our day-to-day dark store operations. Our store is open 7 days a week, so this role also requires you to be able to work on weekends and in different shifts. You will be working from our market located in Odense.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a team player, enjoy working independently, and have a good sense of humour, then you might be just the person we are looking for!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking in orders through our Merchant app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Packing groceries &amp;amp; handing them to customers and couriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing our internal systems which include precise information about nutrients and allergens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining order and cleanliness of the store.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in developing our Market&#39;s daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fast learner and have the ability to multitask.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and service-minded are words that describe you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a can do-attitude and enjoy the idea of working in a fast-paced entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are tech savvy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to work both during the day, evenings and weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from working in a grocery store is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in&amp;nbsp;English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the right to work in Denmark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an on-going basis, so if this sounds like an opportunity you want to pursue, apply today!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that we do not accept applications coming through email due to GDPR. Make sure to apply through our careers page!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Salary will be in compliance with HK Collective Bargaining Agreement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt Helsinkidə mərkəzləşmiş istehlakçılar, ticarətçilər və kuryerlər üçün onlayn platforma təmin edən texnologiya şirkətidir. O, ərzaq və digər məhsulları sifariş etmək istəyən şəxslərlə&amp;nbsp; onları satmaq və çatdırmaqda maraqlı olan insanları əlaqələndirir. Bu xidməti təmin etmək üçün Wolt yerli logistikadan pərakəndə proqram təminatı və maliyyə həllərinə qədər geniş spektrli texnologiyalar hazırlayır, həmçinin Wolt Market brendi altında öz ərzaq mağazalarını istifadəçilərə təqdim edir. Wolt-un məhsullarına Wolt+ (müştərilər üçün abunə xidməti), Wolt for Work (şirkətlər üçün ofisə çatdırılmalar və endirimli yemək təklifləri), Wolt for Work ( ticarətçilər üçün malların ən yaxın paylama mərkəzindən ev və ya biznes kimi son təyinat yerinə sürətli daşınması), Wolt&amp;nbsp; Self-Delivery (öz çatdırılma əməkdaşları olan ticarətçilər üçün xidmət) daxildir. Woltun missiyası yerli icmaları gücləndirmək və böyütməklə şəhərləri daha yaxşı etməkdir. 2014-cü ildə təsis edilən Wolt 2022-ci ildə DoorDash şirkəti ilə gücünü birləşdirmişdir. Bu gün DoorDash dünyanın 31 ölkəsində fəaliyyət göstərir onlardan 27-i Wolt məhsulu və brendidir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bəs, niyə Woltda işləmək lazımdır?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woltda, biz bütün işləri tam görməyi hədəfləmişik.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Məsuliyyət hissini, özünüzü inkişaf etdirməyi, mehriban, təvazökar və iddialı insanların əhatəsində olmağı xoşlayırsınızsa, yəqin ki, buradan həzz alacaqsınız.&lt;br&gt;Biz şəhərləri daha yaxşı yerlərə çevirmək üçün çalışırıq və hər həftə böyüməmizi görmək çox gözəldir. Əgər əmək sərf etdiyiniz işlərin reallaşdığını gözünüzlə görmək sizi həyəcanlandırırsa Wolt sizin üçün ola bilər.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Komandada aktiv fəaliyyət göstərmək istəyən hər kəsə səslənirik! Pərakəndə satışın gələcəyini formalaşdıracaq sistemin bir parçası olmaq isyərsinizsə, bizə qoşulmağa tələsin!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vəzifənin təsviri&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wolt Market, Wolt platformasına məxsus yüksək səviyyədə rahatlıq və müştəri təcrübəsi təklif edən supermarketdir. Artıq&amp;nbsp; siz ərzaqların qapınıza işıq sürəti ilə çatması üçün sifariş edə bilərsiniz!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bizim Satış Təmsilçilərimiz isə Bakıdakı Wolt Market mağazalarımızın ürəyi hesab olunur. Siz bütün sifarişlərin paketlərə yığılmasından və bizim Kuryer Tərəfdaşlarımız və ya müştərilərimiz tərəfindən götürülməyə hazır olduğundan məsul olacaqsınız.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Qeyd etmək istəyirik ki, müraciət etdiyiniz vakansiya “full-time” - dır, həftəlik 40 iş saatı nəzərdə tutulur. Alış-veriş prosesimizə yeni nəfəs gətirən&amp;nbsp; əyləncəli komandanın bir parçası olaraq siz gördüyünüz işin nəticəsi ilə də qürur duyacaqsınız. Şirkət olaraq biz adi işləri, qeyri-adi şəkildə və mükəmməl edirik!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Görəcəyiniz işlər&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;“Merchant” tətbiqimizdə sifarişləri qəbul etmək;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ərzaqları yığmaq, qablaşdırmaq və müştərilərə və kuryerlərə təhvil vermək;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qida maddələri və allergenlər haqqında dəqiq məlumatları özündə əks etdirən daxili sistemlərimizi idarə etmək;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mağazanın nizam-intizamına və təmizliyinə riayət etmək;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketimizin gündəlik əməliyyatlarının inkişaf etdirilməsində iştirak etmək.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tez öyrənirsiniz və bir neçə işi birlikdə görə bilirsiniz;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Təşəbbüskar və xidmətyönümlü sözləri sizdən bəhs edir;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;İşlərə “bacararam” münasibəti ilə yanaşırsınız və sürətli iş mühitində işləmək fikrindən zövq alırsınız;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Texnologiya ilə işləmə qabiliyyətinə sahibsiz;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gün ərzində, axşamlar və həftə sonları işləyə bilirsiniz;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mağaza təcrübəsinin olması üstünlüktür;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azərbaycan dili mütləqdir, ingilis dili üstünlüktür;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azərbaycanda işləmək hüququ olmalıdır.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Əgər yüksək inkişaf mühitində işləmək, məsuliyyət almaq və son dərəcə iddialı komandanın bir hissəsi olmaq sizi həyəcanlandırırsa, müraciət etmək və müzakirəyə başlamaq üçün aşağıya klikləyin!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Biz müraciətləri davamlı şəkildə nəzərdən keçiririk. Buna görə də müraciətinizi elə indi göndərin :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/T10nqKEgkmE&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beskrivelse av stillingen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trives du med å jobbe i et dynamisk arbeidsmiljø, er du opptatt av god kundeservice og ønsker å arbeide i et morsomt og ungt team? Er du 16 år eller eldre? Dersom du svarer ja på dette - oppfordrer vi deg til å lese videre!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rollen du leser om nå er en del av Wolt Market - våre egne matbutikker som leverer enestående convenience og verdens ledende kundeservice. Wolt Market er et fantastisk konsept - kunder kan bestille matvarer og få de levert i lynets hastighet!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vi søker etter både heltids- og deltidsansatte Butikkmedarbeidere (Grocery Associates) til vårt fantastiske team i Wolt Market Bergen. Dersom du har fylt 16 år er du hjertelig velkommen til å søke jobb hos oss! I denne rollen vil du være en del av kjernen av vår daglige drift, du vil sikre at alle ordrene som kommer inn fra kunder er plukket og klare til å hentes av våre budpartnere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vår butikk er åpen 7 dager i uken og av denne grunn vil det bety at du må kunne jobbe både i helger og til ulike tider i løpet av Wolt Market sine åpningstider og leveringstider. Om du er en lagspiller, liker å jobbe selvstendig, og har god humor er du kanskje personen vi leter etter!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hva du vil gjøre&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ta imot bestillinger gjennom vår app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plukke og pakke dagligvarer og gi dem til budpartnere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Varemottak av mat og forsyninger vi mottar fra leverandører&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administrere våre interne systemer som inneholder nøyaktig informasjon om næringsstoffer og allergener&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opprettholde orden og renslighet i butikken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Våre forventninger&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du er proaktiv og rask-lærende med evnen til å multitaske&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fleksibilitet med å jobbe i skift på kvelder, inkludert helger og helligdager - vår Wolt Market er åpen 07:00-00:00.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Din arbeidstid vil være senest til 21:00.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du har rett til å jobbe i Norge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hva du får ved å bli med oss&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt krediterer cashback-fordelen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ansatthjelpsprogram&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt-dekkende treningsprogrammer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Høres dette spennende ut så langt?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hvis du er gira på å jobbe i et miljø som er under rask vekst, du tar eierskap, og ønsker å jobbe i et ekstremt ambisiøst team, så klikk under for å søke slik at vi kan starte samtalen med deg!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vi vil vurdere søknader kontinuerlig, så send inn applikasjon din så snart som mulig!&amp;nbsp;🚀&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Do you enjoy working in a dynamic work environment, have a customer-oriented mindset and love working with a fun team? If your answer is yes - then read further!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt is a Finnish technology company and we’re best known for our food delivery platform. Food delivery was just a start, and now we are exploring and expanding our platform with other business verticals in retail and grocery. We’ve grown significantly in the last three years, expanding our operations from just four countries across the Nordics, to 23 countries across Europe and Asia today. And we’re just getting started.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role you are looking at is a part of Wolt Market - our very own grocery stores that deliver unprecedented convenience and world leading customer experience. People across Denmark can order their groceries and have them delivered within 30 minutes!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are searching for&amp;nbsp; part-time Grocery Associates (Youth Worker) to join our awesome team. In this role you are right in the heart of our day-to-day dark store operations. Our store is open 7 days a week, so, this role also requires you to be available to work on weekdays (after school, or morning shifts if you’ve paused school), as well as some availability for weekend shifts.You will be working from our market located in Odense.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a team player, enjoy working independently, and have a good sense of humour, then you might be just the person we are looking for!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking in orders through our Merchant app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Packing groceries &amp;amp; handing them to customers and couriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing our internal systems which include precise information about nutrients and allergens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining order and cleanliness of the store.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in developing our Market&#39;s daily operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fast learner and have the ability to multitask.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and service-minded are words that describe you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a can do-attitude and enjoy the idea of working in a fast-paced entrepreneurial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are tech savvy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to work both during the evenings and weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the right to work in Denmark.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an on-going basis, so if this sounds like an opportunity you want to pursue, apply today!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that we do not accept applications coming through email due to GDPR. Make sure to apply through our careers page!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be in compliance with HK Collective Bargaining Agreement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/o9p8tgN6-pw?si=LSsfw9J80KI8WWln&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tycker du om att arbeta i en dynamisk arbetsmiljö, har ett kundorienterat tänk och älskar att arbeta med ett härligt team? &lt;strong&gt;Är du mellan 15 och 17 år gammal?&lt;/strong&gt; Om ditt svar är ja - läs då vidare!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bakgrund&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt är ett finskt techbolag och vi är mest kända för vår matleverans-plattform. Matleveranser var bara början, och nu utforskar och utökar vi vår plattform med andra områden inom detaljhandel och dagligvaror. Vi har vuxit avsevärt under de senaste tre åren och utökat vår verksamhet från bara fyra länder i Norden till 28 länder i Europa och Asien idag. Och vi har bara börjat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aktuell roll är en del av Wolt Market - våra alldeles egna livsmedelsbutiker som levererar bekvämlighet och en världsledande kundupplevelse. Wolt Market är vårt fantastiska koncept - människor i alla Wolt-länderna kan beställa sina matvaror och få dem levererade med ljusets hastighet! 🤩&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vi söker deltidsanställda butiksmedarbetare för att bli en del av vårt fantastiska team i Stockholm och du kan bli en del av vårt team så fort du fyllt 15 år! I denna roll befinner du dig i hjärtat av vår dagliga butiksverksamhet, en sk Virtual Store - du kommer att se till att alla beställningar är plockade och redo att hämtas av våra kurirpartners eller kunder.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vår butik är öppen 7 dagar i veckan så denna roll kräver även att du kan arbeta helger och i olika skift enligt Wolt Markets öppettider. Om du är en lagspelare, tycker om att arbeta självständigt och har ett gott sinne för humor, så är du kanske precis den person vi söker!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vad du ska göra&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ta emot beställningar via vår Merchant-app&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plocka och packa matvaror och lämna dem till kunder och kurier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hantera våra interna system som inkluderar exakt information om näringsämnen och allergener.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upprätthålla ordning och reda i butiken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Delta i att utveckla vår dagliga drift i butiken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vem du är&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du är snabblärd och har förmågan att multitaska&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proaktiv och serviceminded är ord som beskriver dig bra&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du har en kan-göra-attityd och tycker om idén att arbeta i en fartfylld entreprenörsmiljö&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du är tekniskt kunnig&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du kan arbeta både dagtid, sena kvällar och helger&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Erfarenhet från tidigare arbete i livsmedelsbutik är meriterande&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du har mycket goda kunskaper i engelska, svenska är ett plus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du har rätt att arbeta i Sverige&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du är 15-17 år gammal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Om du gillar att arbeta i en miljö med hög tillväxt där du kommer kunna ta ägarskap och vara en del av ett extremt ambitiöst team, klicka nedan för att ansöka!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Att arbeta på Wolt Market är inte bara roligt, det är dessutom tryggt och säkert! Som anställd på Wolt Market omfattas du av Handels kollektivavtal för Lager och E-handel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vi kommer att granska ansökningarna löpande, så vänta inte, skicka in din ansökan snarast! 🤩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tražiš dinamičan posao u inovativnoj trgovini bez blagajne i bez direktnog kontakta s kupcima? 🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pridruži se našem timu Wolt Marketa u Zagrebu i budi dio budućnosti maloprodaje! Očekuje te rad u Wolt Marketima &lt;strong&gt;(dark store) &lt;/strong&gt;gdje pripremaš online narudžbe i pomažeš da kupci dobiju proizvode brzo i točno.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌 Što ćeš raditi?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✅&lt;/strong&gt; Obrada online narudžbi putem aplikacije 📲&lt;br&gt;✅ Zaprimanje i skladištenje robe 🏪&lt;br&gt;✅ Održavanje točnosti zaliha i označavanje proizvoda 🔄&lt;br&gt;✅ Održavanje radnog prostora i praćenje HACCP standarda 🛒&lt;br&gt;✅ Rad u timu i brza komunikacija 📢&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👌 Što tražimo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔹 &lt;/strong&gt;Odlične organizacijske vještine i preciznost&lt;br&gt;🔹 Brzinu, snalažljivost i sposobnost rješavanja više zadataka odjednom&lt;br&gt;🔹 Dobro razumijevanje korisničkog iskustva&lt;br&gt;🔹 Otvorenost za rad u digitalnim aplikacijama&lt;br&gt;🔹 Poželjno iskustvo u sličnom poslu ili iskustvo rada u trgovini&lt;br&gt;🔹 Minimalno srednja stručna sprema&lt;br&gt;🔹 Poznavanje hrvatskog i engleskog jezika&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Što ti nudimo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💰 &lt;/strong&gt;Početna bruto plaća je 1.388,40 €, plus 50% dodataka za noćne i vikend smjene, a što duže ostaneš s nama, to će i tvoja plaća rasti! 🚀&lt;br&gt;🍽️ Naknada za prehranu&lt;br&gt;🚆 Pokriveni troškovi javnog prijevoza (do 110 €)&lt;br&gt;📈 Mogućnost napredovanja na Shift Lead poziciju&lt;br&gt;🏖️ Minimalno 25 dana godišnjeg odmora + dodatni plaćeni dani&lt;br&gt;🏋️ Mogućnost korištenja PassSport programa&lt;br&gt;🎄 Božićnica + ostali benefiti iz kolektivnog ugovora za trgovine&lt;br&gt;📚 Strukturirano mentoriranje i obuka od 3 tjedna&lt;br&gt;🎉 Timska druženja i odlična radna atmosfera&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⏰ Radno vrijeme&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📆 &lt;/strong&gt;5-dnevni radni tjedan, s mogućnošću povezivanja slobodnih dana&lt;br&gt;🕗 Smjenski rad (jutarnja i popodnevna smjena)&lt;br&gt;🚫 Ne radimo blagdanima!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎓 Kako izgleda uvođenje u posao?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌 &lt;/strong&gt;Prva 3 tjedna radit ćeš uz trenera u stvarnom okruženju&lt;br&gt;📌 Mentorstvo od strane Team Leada&lt;br&gt;📌 Edukacije, treninzi i radionice za usavršavanje vještina&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔵 Zainteresiran/a? Prijavi se odmah!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💾 Molimo priloži životopis u PDF formatu.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

