oth morning and evening shifts across weekdays and weekends&amp;nbsp;- our&amp;nbsp;store is open 7 days a week. You&#39;ll need to have a transportation to commute during early morning and late evening hours. We require flexibility to work across all our working hours, including weekends and public holidays&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;You have a full professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get by joining us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wolt credits cashback benefit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Visma advantage benefits program&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Wolt-wide training programs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;

