&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you a team player with great communication skills? Do you enjoy working in a dynamic environment? If your answer is yes - then read further! 🤩&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for &lt;strong&gt;part-time (min 20h/week) &lt;/strong&gt;Support Associates to join our Support team in&lt;strong&gt; Riga&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our customers, courier partners and venues via live chat and phone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring that the delivery operations run smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing our support function together with the support team as well as other teams within Wolt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have great communication skills with a personal touch, and a customer-obsessed and team-oriented mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a fast learner, you have no problem with multitasking, and you are ready to work in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This part-time role is specifically for evening shifts between 18:00-22:00 five days a week and requires you to be able to work on weekends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is fully on-site - we expect you to be able to work from the office from Monday to Friday, with an option to work remotely from home on the weekends.&amp;nbsp;Our office is located in the center of Riga.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in Latvian and&amp;nbsp;have professional working proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get by joining us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt credits cashback benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee assistance program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wolt-wide training programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Yearly team budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coffee and snacks at the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are excited about working in a high-growth environment, taking ownership, and being part of an extremely ambitious team, then click below to apply and get the conversation going!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will be reviewing applications on an on-going basis, so send through your application along with your CV as soon as possible! 💙&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Please submit your application in English!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The starting salary for this role is 10.14 €/h gross (during probation) and 10.63 € after the probation period&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Sustainability &amp;amp; Community Impact team at DoorDash works across our global brands — DoorDash, Wolt, and Deliveroo — to advance the company&#39;s approach to the issues that matter most to our business, our communities, and the world we operate in. We sit within the Policy and Communications function and work closely with other teams on a daily basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Lead, Global ESG Reporting to build and lead DoorDash&#39;s global ESG reporting function from the ground up. This is a new role: the first dedicated strategic owner of ESG disclosures across the company. As regulations proliferate across jurisdictions (from the EU&#39;s CSRD to California&#39;s SB 253 to Australia&#39;s Modern Slavery Act), DoorDash needs someone to bring clarity, structure, and strategic thinking to a landscape that is growing in both volume and complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role spans more ground than a traditional ESG reporting function: alongside disclosure strategy and regulatory compliance, you&#39;ll own our GHG measurement program and Scopes 1 &amp;amp; 2 emissions strategy, and manage the growing volume of ESG data requests we receive from enterprise partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll set the strategy, build the infrastructure, and become the internal expert on all things ESG reporting and disclosure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own DoorDash&#39;s global strategy for ESG-related disclosures — determining how, when, and at what level of ambition we respond to mandatory regulations, voluntary frameworks, and reputational expectations across all jurisdictions including the EU, UK, US, Canada, and Australia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal expert and cross-functional DRI on ESG reporting, aligning Legal, Finance and Technical Accounting, IR, Communications, Policy, HR, and Operations around a coherent approach and holding the narrative and numbers together across all external-facing disclosures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the reporting infrastructure, processes, and governance needed for the company to meet its disclosure obligations efficiently and consistently — establishing what doesn&#39;t yet exist and improving on what does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for enterprise partner ESG data requests, building processes to address a growing volume of vendor questionnaires, framework-specific data fields, and merchant-facing disclosures in a scalable way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee GHG measurement — working closely with a measurement vendor, coordinating data collection across the business, and ensuring our approach is audit-ready as assurance requirements mature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own DoorDash&#39;s Scopes 1 &amp;amp; 2 emissions strategy — building a forward-looking plan to drive operational efficiency across our facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful experience in ESG, sustainability reporting, compliance, or a closely related field — with hands-on ownership of major reporting frameworks such as CSRD/ESRS, TCFD, GRI, SASB, Modern Slavery, and/or CDP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine builder mindset: you&#39;ve created reporting infrastructure or processes from scratch before, not just maintained what someone else built (and you&#39;re energized by that kind of work)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional influencer who can align stakeholders across Legal, Finance, IR, and Operations without direct authority, and who is comfortable being the person others look to for direction rather than waiting to be told what to do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication skills — you can draft a regulatory disclosure, write an internal strategy memo, and brief a senior stakeholder, all with equal fluency and appropriate calibration to your audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A principled, business-grounded view of ESG: you take compliance seriously, bring genuine expertise to the space, and can advise leadership on where to invest and lead versus where meeting requirements is the right call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to build a new function and strategy, with real visibility across a global company. You&#39;ll be joining at an exciting moment: before the wave of regulatory requirements fully lands. The work is substantive and growing — from CSRD groundwork to enterprise partner data requests to our Scopes 1 &amp;amp; 2 strategy — and the cross-functional network you&#39;ll build (Legal, Finance, IR, Comms, Ops) means you&#39;ll have meaningful exposure from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our process includes a short screener after resume review, followed by a series of interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt is building the future of local commerce, right in your pocket. To make this possible, we develop a wide range of technologies, including retail and merchant tools, advertising and growth solutions, fulfillment and last mile delivery and financial solutions. As part of our New Verticals business, we also operate our own grocery stores under the Wolt Market brand. Our ambition is big, and so are the legal questions that come with launching and scaling different business lines across our 30+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a generalist Legal Counsel to join our Legal team based in Berlin, who is comfortable working across a broad range of legal topics. Your primary responsibility areas will be supporting our market in Germany as well as other European markets, with a focus on commercial law and regulatory as well as other industry relevant matters. Wolt is part of DoorDash, one of the world’s leading local commerce platforms. You will be part of a joint global legal organization and collaborate with DoorDash and Deliveroo legal colleagues to share learnings and identify opportunities to work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Director Legal Germany with identifying and proactively managing risk across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted legal partner to the business, providing clear and pragmatic advice on a wide range of commercial and operational matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a point of contact for legal queries, supporting stakeholders across multiple functions with timely and solution-oriented guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review and negotiate a variety of commercial agreements, ensuring alignment with business objectives while managing legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams including Marketing, Retail, Sales and other business lines, supporting their specific legal needs and enabling business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with international legal colleagues at DoorDash and Deliveroo to ensure alignment and consistency across jurisdictions and legal processes and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and continuous improvement of legal templates, processes and ways of working to enhance efficiency and scalability of legal support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic projects and initiatives including compliance, helping the business move fast while staying compliant and well-informed from a legal perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully qualified German lawyer (First and Second State Exam) with 5+ years of relevant professional experience, ideally with at least some experience gained in an in-house environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in commercial law, with the ability to independently handle and advise on a broad range of business-critical matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong AI fluency, including a proactive and responsible approach to using AI tools to enhance legal analysis, improve efficiency, and support business decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work effectively in cross-functional environments, collaborating closely with teams such as Marketing, Retail and Sales to find practical, business-friendly solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in German and English (written and spoken), enabling you to operate confidently in an international setting; Polish language skills are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured and pragmatic way of working, with the ability to manage multiple priorities, stay focused under pressure and adapt quickly to new topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and approachable mindset, paired with strong stakeholder management skills and a genuine willingness to take ownership and grow with the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an individual contributor role where you are trusted to take ownership and independently drive legal matters within your areas of responsibility. We are looking for someone who is a strong legal expert in commercial and regulatory matters, and who is also curious, eager to learn and excited to help build something new. You will work closely with a wide range of stakeholders, including global and local commercial and operations teams. You will report to the Director Legal Germany. The role is based in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Along with a competitive salary and benefits, you will also be eligible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Opportunity to be part of building something exceptional, in an international environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lots of learning and growth in a globally scaling tech company. Hybrid work model, blending office presence with flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt is scaling at a breathtaking pace, and our &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Restaurants Team&lt;/strong&gt; is the engine behind our global growth. We aren&#39;t just looking for an account manager; we are looking for a strategic architect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the charge in activating and growing Wolt’s relationships with the world’s most iconic restaurant brands. This role sits at the intersection of high-stakes business development and best-in-class account management. What you build here won&#39;t just impact one market, it will define our strategy across &lt;strong&gt;30+ countries&lt;/strong&gt; and set the gold standard for our global partners like Deliveroo and DoorDash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Be Excited&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect the Blueprint:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end strategy for our largest partners, from initial pilot and massive rollouts to long-term sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Solve complex, partner-specific challenges including POS integrations, bespoke reporting, and operational overhauls that move the needle for the entire industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence at the Highest Level:&lt;/strong&gt; You won&#39;t just be &quot;managing&quot;; you’ll be using deep data insights to sell Wolt’s full suite of products to C-suite executives at top-tier global brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Command:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the &quot;glue&quot; between our partners and Wolt’s Product, Marketing, Legal, and Finance teams to turn ambitious ideas into reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a rare blend of &lt;strong&gt;analytical rigor&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;visionary leadership&lt;/strong&gt;. You are likely a fit if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a Seasoned Strategist:&lt;/strong&gt; You have 5+ years of experience in high-impact environments such as management consulting, investment banking, strategy &amp;amp; ops, or leading a startup from seed to exit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Speak the Language of Data:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable with SQL and AI, using data not just to report, but to tell a story and drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Build and Lead:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience managing multifunctional teams, including Design, Engineering, and Finance, and know how to align them toward a single, ambitious goal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are a Master Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You are as comfortable presenting a long-term vision to a Top-10 Partner CEO as you are diving into the weeds with our internal product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Think Big Picture:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t just hit targets; you develop formalized goals that level up both the partnership and Wolt’s entire global ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, your success is Wolt&#39;s success. By refining how we manage our largest enterprise partners, you ensure that Wolt remains the most trusted and effective platform for the world’s biggest restaurant groups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, we’re building one of the most exciting media ecosystems in Europe - helping partners grow through Wolt Ads and Wolt Promos. By joining the team, you’ll be at the forefront of digital advertising, working on campaigns that drive visibility, engagement, and real results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help partners grow their business by getting closer to the customers who matter most. Through high-impact placements across our app (and beyond), we help them boost brand visibility, reach new audiences, and increase sales.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are now looking for a Merchant Account Development Manager to join our team in &lt;strong&gt;Sweden.&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, you’ll ensure campaigns are launched smoothly, tracked accurately, and optimized for maximum performance while supporting partners and collaborating with internal account managers and teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Merchant Account Development Manager to lead our partnerships efforts for our Restaurant and Merchants ads and promos business. This role will be responsible for driving revenue growth through direct sales and strategic merchant partnerships. The ideal candidate will have experience in ad sales, a strong track record of delivering results, and the ability to convert restaurant and merchant partners into advertising clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Wolt Ads Product team is responsible for building our Ads business across 23 countries. Together with our local sales teams, the Merchant Account Development Manager is responsible for ensuring the delivery of Ad &amp;amp; Promos sales targets in the country they operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be reporting to our local Head of Commercial and our Global Advertising Lead. This person will be a key member in both the Global Ads team and local merchant team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a comprehensive local strategy to drive revenue growth for our restaurant and merchant ads business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage relationships with key industry players, including global brands, franchises, and local restaurants and merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a comprehensive ads and promos sales strategy to achieve revenue targets and drive customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivate a high-performing local sales team to exceed ad revenue targets and customer acquisition and retention goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including product development, marketing, and operations, to ensure sales objectives are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement sales processes and procedures to improve sales efficiency and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze sales performance metrics and provide regular updates to leadership on sales ROI and key trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close advertising investment deals with a focus on revenue growth, product adoption, and customer engagement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of 3 in the local ads and promo team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, marketing, or a related field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in sales management in relevant industries (advertising sales, restaurants, retail)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;with a proven ability to lead and motivate a high-performing sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both &lt;strong&gt;Swedish &lt;/strong&gt;and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, both verbal and written, with the ability to present to senior executives and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation skills with a focus on win-win solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to use data to inform decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of successfully driving revenue growth through partnerships or ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation skills with a focus on win-win solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An opportunity to be part of one of the fastest-growing media ecosystems in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
