&lt;li&gt;Review and validate partner information, cross-checking with signed contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and review partner menus for accuracy and proper structure; coordinate translations if needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate photography and ensure 100% image coverage for each partner during onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and distribute Wolt gear, ensuring partners are trained on proper usage&lt;/li&gt;
