&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;196zdr1&quot; data-start=&quot;2689&quot; data-end=&quot;2774&quot;&gt;Experience working in HR, ideally within a multinational or fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jhf7cq&quot; data-start=&quot;2775&quot; data-end=&quot;2865&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of core HR practices, employee relations and employment legislation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1x6a7ue&quot; data-start=&quot;2866&quot; data-end=&quot;2968&quot;&gt;Comfortable managing sensitive employee matters with professionalism, integrity and sound judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18xu2tb&quot; data-start=&quot;2969&quot; data-end=&quot;3088&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to identify improvements and drive process excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
