&lt;p&gt;We review applications on an ongoing basis, so apply today!&lt;br&gt;If you have any questions about the role, feel free to reach out to [insert name/title].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Due to GDPR, we do not accept applications via email. Apply directly through our careers page.&lt;/p&gt;
