&lt;li&gt;Analyze the market and identify potential restaurants to approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate leads through cold calls, outreach, and on-site visits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and nurture strong relationships with restaurant owners and decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present tailored proposals, negotiate terms, and finalize contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handover newly signed restaurants smoothly to the onboarding team for activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
