&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural hunter with the drive to build a portfolio from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated consultative sales approach with the ability to tailor offerings to partner needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and execute in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills to support data-driven sales decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Greek and English&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
