&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Specialist you are part of Wolt’s SMB team in a given market. This role is a great opportunity for an entrepreneurial person to enter a hands-on role, being one of the first employees on the ground. In this role, you will also be working closely with your Restaurant/Retail Development&amp;nbsp; Manager&amp;nbsp; to&amp;nbsp; ensure&amp;nbsp; that&amp;nbsp; restaurants and retail partners&amp;nbsp; are supported&amp;nbsp; throughout&amp;nbsp; their&amp;nbsp; on-boarding stages,&amp;nbsp; as&amp;nbsp; well&amp;nbsp; as&amp;nbsp; with&amp;nbsp; our&amp;nbsp; marketing&amp;nbsp; and&amp;nbsp; operations&amp;nbsp; teams&amp;nbsp; to&amp;nbsp; help&amp;nbsp; our&amp;nbsp; partners&amp;nbsp; be successful. Wolt is growing rapidly and you will be an integral part of this growth story by expanding to several cities in your market and getting more people to experience the benefits with Wolt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below follows a brief description of selected tasks and some focus areas for the role:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish New Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential partnerships and contact partners that are a great fit for Wolt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with identified partners and their owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop and implement a sales strategy aligned to our partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct negotiations with partners regarding partnership terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking care for a given region and venue portfolio in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the potential performance of the venue in order to set profitable business terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making sound business decisions while informing your intuition with data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Development Managers to ensure that venue partnerships are set up for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with onboarding Team Lead on onboarding new partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In close collaboration with the Team Lead on creating and implementing new plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Attributes Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This individual must:&lt;/p&gt;
