&lt;li&gt;Have a self-starter mindset and willingness to contribute to hands-on activities in a flat organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to collaborate and proactively communicate clearly both verbally and in written form with various stakeholders in Slovenia and globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to make sound business decisions while basing decisions on data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to fluently express himself/herself&amp;nbsp; in English and Slovenian language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be based in or have strong working mobility across our key regional markets: Koper, Izola, Piran, Portorož, Lucija, Nova Gorica, Sežana, and Kozina&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to prioritize Wolt culture and values as the fundamental elements of Wolt growing as a successful business&lt;/li&gt;
