&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As Sales Support Associate, you will focus on onboarding and supporting new venues, ensuring a seamless setup and smooth day-to-day operations. You’ll also assist Account Managers with administrative tasks, coordinate with internal teams, and provide training and guidance to partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Train partner venues on how to use Wolt’s tools and equipment effectively and independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure partners meet the highest Wolt service standards through regular quality and satisfaction checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Account Management team with partner-related administrative tasks and coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to merchant inquiries, resolve onboarding-related issues, and ensure a seamless experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Account Managers and internal teams to maintain quality standards during onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a portfolio of smaller clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upsell and cross-sell to our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations*&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
