&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Senior Software Engineer, People Apps is a key member of the IT-Automations team at Wolt. This role involves working closely with various IT functions and stakeholder organizations within the company to develop and maintain automation solutions that enhance the employee experience. You will be part of a team of highly skilled engineers and developers dedicated to preemptively identifying and addressing the needs of over 10,000+ employees worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and deploy services and applications related to automated employee lifecycle management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and develop Wolt’s custom-built automation engine and internally directed full-stack applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with various stakeholder groups to provide automated solutions that assist in their day-to-day tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare instructions and documentation for the developed applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve existing codebases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and resolve potential needs for our employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with other IT functions to help maintain a world-class employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge of Python, Flask, FastAPI, React, Vue.js, Pytest, and PostgreSQL (and other data storage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest and relevant experience in software engineering and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who keeps up with automation trends and tries out new technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional communication skills and fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A quick thinker who rolls up their sleeves and always finds solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel if needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Frameworks: Python, Flask, FastAPI, Vue.js, React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Tools: Kubernetes, Terraform, AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing: Pytest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Software Engineer join our Go initative within the Merchant Group at Wolt! If you have a strong track record of building and maintaining scalable, production-grade systems you like to drive impact at scale and mentor juniors and peers - this is the place for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Merchant Group consists of 150+ engineers across 25+ cross-functional teams, working together to help merchants grow their businesses and streamline operations through innovative technology. Some of us focus on building seamless experiences for our merchants, while others work on the behind-the-scenes magic that makes everything run smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior engineer in our group, you’ll work your magic in Go or Kotlin (and some Kotlin) helping shape how merchants succeed with Wolt. You’ll have opportunities to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and scale reliable systems that power merchant experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the full development lifecycle – from business logic and testing to cloud infrastructure and data streaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on architecture and technology choices that keep our systems simple, scalable, and efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your skills and knowledge by working alongside experienced teammates in an environment that values learning and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership – Our engineers have end-to-end responsibility for their services, from implementation to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration – Architecture and working methods are defined together, ensuring we make the best choices for long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalability &amp;amp; Simplicity – We value pragmatic solutions that keep our systems robust without unnecessary complexity. We use technologies that serve Wolt, our teams, and our engineers best. You’ll have the freedom to experiment and adopt the tools that work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core technologies include Go, as well as Kotlin (Ktor, Koin, Spring, gRPC), PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Kafka, Redis, GitHub Actions, AWS, Docker, and Kubernetes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wolt is a place where you can learn, teach, and grow. If you’re passionate about building great technology and working in an environment that values teamwork and autonomy, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;📍This open role are based in our tech hubs in Helsinki or Stockholm. We work in distributed teams, but might not be able to offer fully remote work or relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking an experienced Software Engineer, so we expect that you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Not only understand customer problems but can break them down into actionable steps for both yourself and the team. You balance short-term needs with long-term goals, creating high-quality, scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by example, setting high standards for work quality and managing projects effectively, even in uncertain situations. You take full ownership of your team’s work, making improvements that benefit both customers and colleagues. You regularly spot gaps and provide valuable recommendations to cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are used to being a role model and informal leader, collaborating with partner teams and mentoring both juniors and peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are an excellent communicator, being succint and to the point.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are continuously reviewing applications, so don’t hesitate to apply today - you will hear back from us as soon as possible.&lt;br&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Client Platform Engineering team is responsible for configuration, management and automation of macOS, iOS, Windows, ChromeOS and Android endpoints to help DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt employees and merchants do their best work. CPE is a global team with members in the United States and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior IT Engineer - Device Management who values responsibility and accountability for the management of corporate and merchant endpoints globally. Our growing environment is predominantly macOS (corporate) and Android (merchant) but includes a mix of other operating systems. You will report to the Manager, Client Platform Engineering on our Corporate Infrastructure team in the Global IT organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support timely, technical solutions to scale endpoint management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look for opportunities for automation to mitigate manual processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage Android and iPadOS tablets in the merchant fleet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage macOS and ChromeOS laptops in the corporate fleet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to develop processes and ideas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years experience administering an Enterprise MDM/EMM/UEM platform (Mosyle, Intune, MaaS360, Workspace ONE, SimpleMDM, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years experience managing large-scale Android and/or iPadOS deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years experience managing macOS, preferably with the following tools: Munki, AutoPkg, Santa, osquery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years experience in one or more of the following programming languages: Bash, Python, Swift, GoLang&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience using CI/CD for client engineering processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience utilizing APIs for automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing ChromeOS, Windows and Linux endpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have rolled out or managed a mobile BYOD program (Apple User Enrollment / Android Work Profile)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience deploying and managing Conditional Access / Device Trust policies and integrations (Okta / Google)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with configuration/infrastructure as code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy working with open source tools and contributing back to the community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working on a remote team spanning multiple time zones and continents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you’ll love working at Wolt&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in 1000+ cities in over 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All applications are reviewed by a real human, so please be patient. Qualified candidates will have the opportunity to speak with a member of our recruiting team before moving on to talk with the hiring manager. This is a highly technical role so the next step will be a live scripting/coding interview, followed by chats with members of the team and cross-functional partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to fill this role as quickly as possible, but are committed to finding the right candidate who will be successful in the role.&lt;/p&gt;
