&lt;p&gt;You’re a great fit if you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly, warmly, and with a customer-first mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn quickly, multitask with ease, and enjoy a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability and the right to work in Hungary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work minimum 30 hours per week as a student across different shift types (morning, night, weekend) as required since we operate 24/7&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in Hungarian and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
